    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are well versed in the hit-and-run tactics used by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance\" title=\"The Rebel Alliance\">The Rebel Alliance</a> and know how to use your mobility to avoid retribution.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Running_Attack\" title=\"Running Attack\">Running Attack</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Whenever you use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Running_Attack\" title=\"Running Attack\">Running Attack</a> feat to move both before and after making an attack, you gain a +2 dodge bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> until the start of your next turn.</p>",
